̃́lɛpiu, a gↄ̃ bɛzia ũo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Lua a dↄaàlɛ gudↄlɛia.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Bui píi lɛ́ wiilɛ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"kpalaↄ lɛ́ bãdɛ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Lua pũ̀na ↄ̃ dṹnia yↄ̀.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Dii Zĩgↄ̃de kúwanↄ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Yakↄbu buiↄ Lua mɛ́ wá ulɛkĩi ũ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"À mↄ Dii yãkɛaↄ gwa,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"lá à yãyìa dṹniawa.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ɔ̃mɛ ì zĩ midɛ e dṹnia lɛ́u,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ì sáↄ ɛ́'ɛ ì sↄ̃naↄ suumpa,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ì tɛsↄ̃ sɛ̀ngbaoↄwa.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"À zɛ tɛɛɛ, íↄ dↄ̃ mámɛmaa Lua.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Bui píi a ma kã́fĩ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"wa ma tↄbↄ dṹnia guu píi.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Dii Zĩgↄ̃de kúwanↄ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Yakↄbu buiↄ Lua mɛ́ wá ulɛkĩi ũ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/bqc_sim/PSA/46.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/bqc_sim/PSA/47.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/bqc_sim/PSA/45.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}